property_value: external_definition "outermost layer of connective tissue surrounding a peripheral nerve. It includes the blood vessels supplying the nerve. It consists of adipose tissue and fibrocollagenous tissues[Wikipedia:Epineurium]." xsd:string {source="Wikipedia:Epineurium"}

[Term]
id: UBERON:0000125
name: neural nucleus
