[Term]
id: UBERON:0001035
name: dento-alveolar joint
def: "A joint that binds the teeth to the alveolar ridge." [http://orcid.org/0000-0002-6601-2165, Wikipedia:Gomphosis]
synonym: "dento-alveolar syndesmosis" EXACT [FMA:7495]
