[Term]
id: UBERON:0001300
name: scrotum
def: "The external sac of skin that encloses the testes. It is an extension of the abdomen, and in placentals is located between the penis and anus." [ISBN:0-683-40008-8, MP:0002669, Wikipedia:Scrotum]
