synonym: "optic papilla" RELATED [Wikipedia:Optic_disc]
synonym: "physiologic blind spot" RELATED [Wikipedia:Optic_disc]
synonym: "physiologic blind spot of mariotte" RELATED [Wikipedia:Optic_disc]
