property_value: external_definition "Dermal bone that forms the anteriormost element of the upper jaw. It articulates with the maxilla posterodorsally and its antimere medially. The premaxilla is paired.[TAO]" xsd:string {date_retrieved="2012-08-14", external_class="TAO:0000567", ontology="TAO", source="ZFIN:curator"}
property_value: external_definition "One of the bones of the upper jaw situated between and in front of the maxillae. [Dorian_AF, Elsevier's_encyclopaedic_dictionary_of_medicine, Part_B:_Anatomy_(1988)_Amsterdam_etc.:_Elsevier][VHOG]" xsd:string {date_retrieved="2012-09-17", external_class="VHOG:0000426", ontology="VHOG", source="http://bgee.unil.ch/"}
