[Term]
id: UBERON:0002741
name: diagonal band of Broca
def: "A white fibre bundle descending in the precommissural septum toward the base of the forebrain, immediately rostral to the lamina terminalis; at the base, the bundle turns in the caudolateral direction; traveling through the ventral substantia innominata alongside the optic tract, it fades before reaching the amygdala." [BIRNLEX:1551]
