synonym: "vestibular part of vestibulocochlear ganglion" EXACT [http://orcid.org/0000-0002-6601-2165]
synonym: "vestibulocochlear ganglion vestibular component" RELATED [EMAPA:17573]
synonym: "vestibulocochlear VIII ganglion vestibular component" EXACT [MA:0001086]
