[Term]
id: UBERON:0003105
name: dorsal lateral plate region
def: "Embryonic tissue derived from the mesodermal germ layer that contains the dorsal aorta, genital ridges and mesonephros. This region is the first autonomous embryonic site for definitive haematopoiesis." [PMID:29358215]
