[Term]
id: UBERON:0003209
name: blood nerve barrier
def: "Barrier between the perineurium of peripheral nerves and the vascular endothelium of endoneurial capillaries. The perineurium acts as a diffusion barrier, but ion permeability at the blood-nerve barrier is still higher than at the blood-brain barrier[GO]." [GO:0008065, Wikipedia:Blood-nerve_barrier]
