[Term]
id: UBERON:0003277
name: skeleton of upper jaw
def: "A subdivision of the skeleton that corresponds to the upper part of the mouth. The lower jaw skeleton includes the following elements, when present: upper jaw teeth, the maxilla and other lower jaw bones." [http://orcid.org/0000-0002-6601-2165]
