intersection_of: UBERON:0003909 ! sinusoid
intersection_of: part_of UBERON:0001250 ! red pulp of spleen
relationship: in_taxon NCBITaxon:40674 ! Mammalia
relationship: never_in_taxon NCBITaxon:10088 {source="http://www.informatics.jax.org/greenbook/chapters/chapter13.shtml"} ! Mus <genus>
relationship: never_in_taxon NCBITaxon:9681 {source="http://www.informatics.jax.org/greenbook/chapters/chapter13.shtml"} ! Felidae
