relationship: part_of UBERON:0002367 ! prostate gland
property_value: development_notes "Concurrent with branching morphogenesis, the solid cords of epithelium formed by budding arborize and differentiate postnatally into glandular acin. The basic prostate architecture is established by puberty and acquires secretory function thereafter[PMID:18977204]" xsd:string
