relationship: part_of UBERON:0005215 {source="MA"} ! kidney interstitium
property_value: function_notes "It functions in renal water reabsorption by building up a high hypertonicity, which draws water out of the thin descending limb of the loop of Henle and the collecting duct system. This hypertonicity, in turn, is created by an efflux of urea from the inner medullary collecting duct." xsd:string

