synonym: "intercostales externi muscles" RELATED [Wikipedia:External_intercostal_muscles]
synonym: "intercostales externus" EXACT [MA:0002325]
synonym: "intercostalis externus" RELATED [Wikipedia:External_intercostal_muscles]
synonym: "intercostals external" RELATED [Wikipedia:External_intercostal_muscles]
synonym: "intercostals external muscle" RELATED [Wikipedia:External_intercostal_muscles]
synonym: "musculi intercostales externi" RELATED OMO:0003011 [Wikipedia:External_intercostal_muscles]
