synonym: "gracile column" RELATED [Wikipedia:Gracile_fasciculus]
synonym: "gracile fascicle" EXACT [FMA:258416]
synonym: "gracile tract" RELATED [Wikipedia:Gracile_fasciculus]
synonym: "gracilis tract" EXACT [GO:0021958]
synonym: "tract of Goll" RELATED [GO:0021958]
