xref: Wikipedia:Middle_nasal_concha
is_a: UBERON:0003973 ! nasal concha of ethmoid bone
property_value: depiction "http://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e6/Gray151.png" xsd:anyURI

