relationship: part_of UBERON:0005922 ! inferior nasal concha
property_value: taxon_notes "In many carnivores and ungulates, the ethmoturbinals are most complex within a posterosuperior cul-de-sac, the olfactory recess[PMID:25312359]" xsd:string

