synonym: "laryngo-tracheal tube" RELATED [Wikipedia:Laryngotracheal_groove]
synonym: "laryngotracheal endoderm" RELATED []
synonym: "sulcus laryngotrachealis" EXACT OMO:0003011 [Wikipedia:Laryngotracheal_groove]
