[Term]
id: UBERON:0006305
name: tunica vasculosa lentis
def: "An extensive capillary network, spreading over the posterior and lateral surfaces of the lens of the eye. It disappears shortly after birth." [Wikipedia:Tunica_vasculosa_lentis]
