[Term]
id: UBERON:0007763
name: cerebellum vermis culmen
def: "The culmen is the portion of the anterior vermis adjacent to the primary fissure of cerebellum. The culmen and the anterior parts of the quadrangular lobules form the lobus culminis[WP]." [Wikipedia:Culmen_(cerebellum)]
synonym: "cerebellum culmen" EXACT [UBERON:cjm]
synonym: "culmen" BROAD [BIRNLEX:926, MA:0001001]
