synonym: "levator velum palatini muscle" RELATED [Wikipedia:Levator_veli_palatini]
synonym: "musculus levator veli palatini" RELATED OMO:0003011 [Wikipedia:Levator_veli_palatini]
xref: FMA:46727
xref: SCTID:244795001
xref: Wikipedia:Levator_veli_palatini
