id: UBERON:0009554
name: obsolete coffin bone
def: "The bottommost bone in the equine leg and is encased by the hoof capsule. The distal phalanx articulates with both the middle phalanx and the distal sesamoid, forming the distal interphalangeal joint." [Wikipedia:Coffin_bone]
comment: Was made obsolete in favor of the more generic grouping
is_obsolete: true
replaced_by: UBERON:0014485

