intersection_of: extends_fibers_into UBERON:0001780 ! spinal nerve
intersection_of: extends_fibers_into UBERON:0002240 ! spinal cord
relationship: contributes_to_morphology_of UBERON:0001780 ! spinal nerve
relationship: contributes_to_morphology_of UBERON:0002240 ! spinal cord
