[Term]
id: UBERON:0010244
name: choroid tapetum lucidum
def: "A tapetum lucidum that is part of the choroid. The choroidal tapetum lucidum lies immediately adjacent to the choriocapillaris and external to the retinal epithelium." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6601-2165, PMID:14738502, Wikipedia:Tapetum_lucidum#Classification]
synonym: "choroidal tapetum lucidum" EXACT []
synonym: "tapetum choroideae" EXACT [BTO:0001828]
xref: BTO:0001828
xref: SCTID:3034006
xref: Wikipedia:Tapetum_lucidum#Classification
