xref: AAO:0000460
xref: Wikipedia:Prefrontal_bone
is_a: UBERON:0008907 {source="ISBN:0073040584"} ! dermal bone
relationship: adjacent_to UBERON:0000209 ! tetrapod frontal bone
relationship: adjacent_to UBERON:0001680 ! lacrimal bone
relationship: in_taxon NCBITaxon:8287 {source="Wikipedia"} ! Sarcopterygii
relationship: never_in_taxon NCBITaxon:40674 ! Mammalia
relationship: never_in_taxon NCBITaxon:8782 ! Aves
