synonym: "greater tuberosity of humerus" EXACT [FMA:23390]
synonym: "tuberculum majus" EXACT OMO:0003011 [FMA:TA]
synonym: "tuberculum majus humeri" EXACT [Wikipedia:Greater_tubercle]
xref: FMA:23390
xref: NCIT:C32700
xref: SCTID:181934009
xref: UMLS:C1512275 {source="ncithesaurus:Greater_Tuberosity"}
xref: Wikipedia:Greater_tubercle
