[Term]
id: UBERON:0011191
name: ophthalmic vein
def: "Ophthalmic veins are veins which drain the eye. More specifically, they can refer to: Superior ophthalmic vein Inferior ophthalmic vein." [Wikipedia:Ophthalmic_veins]
