name: posterior ethmoidal artery
def: "The posterior ethmoidal artery is an artery of the head. It is smaller than the anterior ethmoidal artery, branches off from the ophthalmic artery when it reaches the medial wall of the orbit." [Wikipedia:Posterior_ethmoidal_artery]
