[Term]
id: UBERON:0013558
name: Brodmann (1909) area 27
def: "Area 27 of Brodmann-1909 is a cytoarchitecturally defined cortical area that is a rostral part of the parahippocampal gyrus of the guenon (Brodmann-1909). It is commonly regarded as a synonym of presubiculum (Crosby-62). [WP,unvetted]." [Wikipedia:Brodmann_area_27]
