intersection_of: part_of UBERON:0035594 ! accessory optic system
relationship: part_of UBERON:0001891 ! midbrain
property_value: taxon_notes "most vertebrates have at least one AON. Mammals have 4.[ISBN:0471888893]" xsd:string

