def: "The anterior inferior iliac spine (AIIS) is a bony eminence on the anterior border of the hip bone, or, more precisely, the wing of the ilium (i.e. the upper lateral parts of the pelvis)." [Wikipedia:Anterior_inferior_iliac_spine]
synonym: "anterior inferior iliac spine (volume)" EXACT [FMA:63614]
synonym: "anterior inferior spine" RELATED [Wikipedia:Anterior_inferior_iliac_spine]
