[Term]
id: UBERON:0013745
name: zona intermedia of adrenal gland
def: "A zone of the adrenal cortex located between the zona glomerulosa and the zona fasciculata." [http://www.endotext.org/adrenal/adrenal1/adrenal1.html]
comment: currently postulated to be a site of initiation of adrenocyte proliferation and differentiation and a zone containing the adrenal cortical stem cells. Present in some rat species.
