def: "Skeletal element that functionally replaces the notochord[VSAP,modified]." [http://orcid.org/0000-0002-6601-2165, https://github.com/obophenotype/uberon/issues/207, https://github.com/obophenotype/uberon/issues/80, VSAO:0000183, VSAO:curator]
