relationship: adjacent_to UBERON:0001833 ! lip
relationship: adjacent_to UBERON:0006956 ! buccal mucosa
relationship: adjacent_to UBERON:0011595 ! jaw region
relationship: part_of UBERON:0000165 ! mouth

