[Term]
id: UBERON:0034877
name: angioblastic cord
def: "The cordlike masses of splanchnic mesenchymal cells ventral to the primordial pericardial coelom that arrange themselves side by side to form the primordia of the endocardial heart tubes." [MP:0012500]
synonym: "angiogenic cell cluster" EXACT []
xref: NCIT:C34106
xref: UMLS:C1515990
