xref: DHBA:10288
xref: DMBA:16058
xref: EMAPA:35432
xref: FMA:242223
xref: MA:0000909
xref: SCTID:369221008
is_a: UBERON:0016529 ! cortex of cerebral lobe
relationship: part_of UBERON:0002022 ! insula

