[Term]
id: UBERON:2005050
name: palatocerebral artery
def: "The PLA branches ventrally from the CrDI. It extends rostrally along the base of mid- and forebrain, then loops medially and links to the corresponding vessel from the other side of the embryo. Isogai et al. 2001." [ZFIN:curator]
