[Term]
id: UBERON:2007004
name: epiphysial cluster
def: "Early-developing neuronal cluster of the epiphysis. By 24 hpf the pioneer axon of the dorsoventral diencephalic tract (DVDT) has arisen from the ec and grown ventrally. As this axon encounters axons of the TPOC, it makes a near-90 rostral turn and grows rostrally among axons of the TPOC growing in the opposite direction. Ross et al., 1992." [ZFIN:curator]
synonym: "ec" EXACT [TAO:0007004]
xref: ZFA:0007004
is_a: UBERON:0000479 ! tissue
relationship: part_of UBERON:0001905 ! pineal body
