[Term]
id: UBERON:6001781
name: insect prothoracic leg disc
def: "Imaginal disc of the ventral prothoracic segment. Precursor of structures of the adult ventral prothorax including the prothoracic (1st) leg." [FlyBase:FBrf0064789]
