[Term]
id: UBERON:8440030
name: striatum-like amygdalar nuclei
def: "A part of the striatum which is primarilly composed of amygdalar areas. The sAMY is composed of the anterior amygdalar area, central amygdalar nucleus, intercalated amygdalar nucleus, medial amygdalar nucleus, and the bed nucleus of the accessory olfactory tract." [MBA:278]
synonym: "sAMY" EXACT [MBA:278]
xref: MBA:278
is_a: UBERON:0002308 ! nucleus of brain
relationship: part_of UBERON:0002435 ! striatum

[Term]
id: UBERON:8440031
name: medial corticohypothalmic tract
def: "The main route taken by fibers from the ventral subiculum to the hypothalamus, where they innervate the medial preoptic area, “shell” of the ventromedial nucleus, dorsomedial nucleus, ventral premammillary  nucleus, and cell-poor zone around the medial mammillary nucleus." [PMID:1430328]
synonym: "mct" EXACT [MBA:428]
xref: MBA:428
is_a: UBERON:0001018 ! axon tract
relationship: part_of UBERON:0001017 ! central nervous system

[Term]
id: UBERON:8440032
name: prelimbic area
def: "A region in the medial prefrontal cortex that is dorsal to the infralimbic area important in expression of conditioned reward and fear behaviour." [PMID:30850668]
synonym: "PL" EXACT [MBA:972]
synonym: "prelimbic cortex" EXACT [PMID:30639183]
synonym: "PrL" EXACT [PMID:30639183]
