[Term]
id: UBERON:8440037
name: accessory facial motor nucleus
def: "A small cluster of neurons dorsal to the facial motor nucleus in the pontine tegmentum." [WikipediaVersioned:Accessory_facial_motor_nucleus&oldid=1046234765]
synonym: "ACVII" EXACT [MBA:576]
xref: MBA:576
is_a: UBERON:0002308 ! nucleus of brain
