[Term]
id: UBERON:8480016
name: perirenal space
def: "A retroperitoneal space that lies between the anterior and posterior renal fascia; it is a paired inverted cone shaped of tissue containing the kidney, the proximal portion of the collecting system, renal and perirenal vasculature, perirenal lymphatics, adrenal glands and variable amount of fat." [PMID:24065628]
synonym: "perinephric space" EXACT [PMID:28050791]
