[Term]
id: UBERON:8480021
name: prevesical space
def: "An extraperitoneal space anterior and lateral to the umbilicovesical fascia, and posterior to the trasversalis fascia. Prevesical space laterally communicates with the properitoneal space of the abdominal wall and flanks; posteroinferiorly it surrounds the lateral walls of the urinary bladder, and anteroinferiorly it forms the retropubic space (the space of Retzius)." [PMID:24065628]
is_a: UBERON:0014456 ! extraperitoneal space
