def: "Part of the glottis most closely associated with the pharynx represented anatomically by the posterior union of the developing cricoid cartilage." [PMID:19501483, PMID:25272366]
synonym: "larynx posterior commissure" RELATED [PMID:25272366]
synonym: "posterior commissure of larynx" RELATED [PMID:25272366]
synonym: "posterior end of the glottis" EXACT [PMID:19501483]
synonym: "posterior glottis" EXACT [PMID:22614807]
synonym: "posterior portion of the glottis" EXACT [PMID:19501483]
