[Term]
id: UBERON:8600023
name: placental villous stroma
def: "A stroma that is part of a chorionic villus (placental villus). A placental villous stroma supports the fetal capillaries and villous trophoblast." [PMID:31512233]
synonym: "chorionic villous stroma" EXACT [PMID:12624135]
synonym: "CVS" RELATED OMO:0003000 [PMID:12624135]
